{
  "about": "The 3D assets of the remake: free (CC0) and downloadable without an account. fetch-assets.ps1 downloads them to <folder> (never committed), the commandlet UghImportAssets (build.ps1) imports them to Content/Imported/<id>. kind: texture (a PBR set: maps by role -> a material instance of M_UghPbr), model (the files of import, glTF or FBX), hdri (a sky), generated (made by a Blender script alone, imported like a model: static meshes, or a skeletal mesh with its animations). Source: polyhaven (the files of its API, https://api.polyhaven.com/files/<id>: <map>.<format> at a resolution, checked by its MD5) or download (a file or an archive, checked by size and SHA-256; an archive is extracted to path), none for a generated asset. blender: a script of Blender/ run on the asset's folder (and the folders of its inputs, ids of assets) that makes outputs.",
